text{-}arithmetical}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{PL}(\\mathrm{PA}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}gl\\text{-}arithmetical}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{PL}(\\mathrm{PA}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\)</span> : GL逻辑 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0006800fa1c85177\" href=\"?note=0006800fa1c85177\" title=\"89-df-gl-logic\">89-df-gl-logic</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PL}(\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\mathrm{PL}(\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span> : 在所有 PA 算术实现下均为 PA 定理的模态公式集</li>\n<li>该包含关系是 GL 算术可靠性的集合形式</li>\n<li>Solovay定理的一半</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-gl-logic","status":"resolved","id":"0006800fa1c85177","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-provability-logic","status":"resolved","id":"19a5fceb5d504d9f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-provability-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-peano-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"86ad48bbd1843ed6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-peano-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-logic","status":"resolved","id":"0006800fa1c85177","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GL}$ : GL逻辑 (see [[89-df-gl-logic]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{GL},\\mathrm{PL}(\\mathrm{PA})\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":